```math
AB = \begin{bmatrix} 1 \end{bmatrix},\qquad A^+ = \begin{bmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \end{bmatrix},\qquad B^+ = \begin{bmatrix} 1/2 & 1/2 \end{bmatrix}
